q.1--plan","local_name":"bob-cli-aq.1--plan","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-aq","agent_clan_generation":"20261023063607","agent_session":"bob-cli-aq.1","agent_session_role":"plan","bead_id":"bob-cli-aq.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-aq[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]One-key recommended roll (Alt+P) with review-walk previews[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]One keystroke on a task applies exactly what the Task Card's [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Ctrl+Enter recommends (same-level roll, decay, or a confirmed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]cancel), and every GTD review landing and the review footer say in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a few words which priority that key would use and whether it [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]decays.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]quick_roll_alt_p.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/quick_roll_alt_p.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-aq[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-aq/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The one-key roll command in bob-navigation-hotkeys[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]quick-roll-key[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]quick-roll-key: add the Task card roll-by-recommendation command on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chosen key, run it as a one-shot Task Card intent that stays invisible [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unless input is needed, alias the key inside the card, rebind the vault [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hotkey, and document it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Roll preview on review-walk landings and api.quickRoll[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]review-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after quick-roll-key[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]review-preview: extract one shared recommendation planner, format the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]concise roll preview, add it as the last line of `]s` landing toasts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and expose it as the additive nav `api.quickRoll` v1 namespace.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Roll preview in the review footer[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]footer-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after review-preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]footer-preview: bob-ledger-tools shows the compact preview in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footer's hint slot and the full sentence in its tooltip while the cursor[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]is on a review row.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Review contract, API contract, and memory updates in bob-cli[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]review-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after quick-roll-key, review-preview, footer-preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]review-docs: update the freshness review ritual and the nav API contract[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in bob-cli docs, apply the accepted memory decisions, and regenerate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generated docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-aq","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-aq.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-aq.1"},"source_run_id":"run-